      "role": "user",
      "content": "i did the right thing. i reported what was happening at the firm, thinking it mattered. but now i dont have a job, no one in my old circle will even take my calls, and i’m just... sitting here alone in this empty apartment. i sacrificed everything for a truth that nobody even cares about. it feels like i traded my entire life for literally nothing.",
